`,c.jsxs(n.p,{children:[c.jsx(n.strong,{children:"Intellectual property"}),": Licensing requests, permissions, and queries concerning the use of OIDI materials. Procedures are set out under ",c.jsx(n.a,{href:"/legal/ip",children:"Intellectual Property"}),"."]}),`
